---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Intra-Household Dog Conflict San Jacinto | Good Doggos";
const description = "Restore peace to your multi-dog household in San Jacinto. We specialize in resolving intra-household conflict through structure, balance, and professional leadership.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Intra-Household Dog Conflict Resolution",
  "description": description,
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "name": "Good Doggos",
    "url": "https://gooddoggos.com",
    "telephone": "+19514016252",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "San Jacinto",
      "addressRegion": "CA",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "AdministrativeArea",
    "name": "Riverside County"
  },
  "url": "https://gooddoggos.com/services/intra-household-conflict"
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero Band -->
  <section class="bg-primary-navy pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-body text-white/50 mt-6 mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Home</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/aggression-rehabilitation" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Aggression Rehabilitation</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <span class="text-white/80 truncate">Intra-Household Conflict</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Household Dog Conflict Resolution in San Jacinto
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body Content -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-[#FCF9FA]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          There is nothing more stressful than living in a home that feels like a battlefield. When your dogs can’t be in the same room without a "crate-and-rotate" system or a fight breaking out, the tension in your San Jacinto home is unbearable.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          These fights are symptoms of a breakdown in the pack dynamic and house rules. Because we are professionals, we do not guess or hand out generic advice without evaluating the dogs together in person first. Management isn't a long-term solution; you need a professional evaluation to find a real path forward.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-primary-navy mt-12 mb-6">
          Restoring Peace Through Structure and Balance
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          At Good Doggos, I specialize in the complex dynamics of multi-dog households. For 8 years, I’ve been stepping into Inland Empire homes where the "pack" has completely fallen apart. My balanced approach is built on the understanding that harmony isn't about the dogs "liking" each other—it's about them respecting you and the rules of the house.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          I once worked with a family whose dogs fought over every bowl of water and every dropped crumb. By treating the dogs like children in a structured environment—nurturing their needs but holding them to firm rules—we stopped the fighting. I used calibrated leash corrections and spatial pressure to tell a dog "no" the moment they gave a territorial "stiffen," while rewarding them for choosing a neutral "look away." 
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          We don't train in a vacuum; we work in your specific "hot zones," from the kitchen during meal prep to the back door. I show you how to implement a structure that removes the "need" for your dogs to compete. Whether you’re dealing with littermate syndrome or a new rescue that isn't fitting in, I provide the leadership skills you need. We aren't looking for "best friends"; we’re looking for a household of neutral, respectful dogs that can chill out even in the peak San Jacinto heat.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6 font-bold">
          Stop living in a house divided. Apply for a Free Behavioral Assessment and take your life back.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     CTA BAND
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FBF1E9]" style="border-top: 1px solid #E6DAC6;">
  <div class="w-full h-[3px]" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #0F6D72, #D1B27F, #0F6D72);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4" style="color: rgba(15,109,114,0.60);">Your Dog Is Next</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4" style="color: #0B2744;">
      Ready to See What's Possible?<br/>
      <span class="headline-accent" style="color: #D1B27F; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;">Start With a Free Assessment.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.60);">
      Tell us about your dog. We'll do an honest assessment and point you toward the right program — or tell you if we're not the right fit.
    </p>
    <a href="/apply"
       class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
       style="background: #D1B27F; color: #0B2744; padding: 18px 44px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(209,178,127,0.35);">
      Apply for Free Behavioral Assessment →
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.40);">Takes less than 3 minutes · No commitment required</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
